## General Best Practices

1. **Commit frequently** - Don't wait until milestones are complete
2. **Use descriptive commit messages** - Make Git history readable
3. **Document decisions** - Update relevant docs as you go
4. **Keep context manageable** - If chat gets unwieldy, export summary
5. **Reference previous work** - Build on what came before
6. **Stay organized** - Clear markers and summaries help

